---

Third-party components redistributed in this repository retain their own
licenses:

- `tools/tla2tools.jar` — the TLA+ Tools (SANY, TLC), MIT License,
  https://github.com/tlaplus/tlaplus
- `tools/CommunityModules-deps.jar`, `tools/community-modules/` — the TLA+
  Community Modules, MIT License,
  https://github.com/tlaplus/CommunityModules
- `tools/extra-modules/` — standard modules shipped with the Apalache model
  checker (Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/apalache-mc/apalache) and
  with the TLA+ tools/community modules (MIT).

`corpus/` is mostly frozen index and config artifacts that point at upstream
specifications rather than vendoring them. The exception is
`corpus/configs/apalache-annotated/`, which holds annotated derivatives of
specs from the 206-spec FormaLLM corpus; those remain under their upstream
license and are included here only as evidence for the Apalache sweep.

TLA+ specifications under `results/` are generated by this project (the W4
cross-family corpus and per-run model outputs) and are covered by the MIT
license above.
